WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:00,980
Asado

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:08,310
Are you finally willing to admit something? I agreed to your request, Mr. Shen.

3
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:09,950
I once owed a life

4
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:13,390
But it has nothing to do with Xia Weiming Qantong Qantong

5
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:18,250
Bai Yuexing, where are you? Come here quickly. What are you doing?

6
00:00:18,370 --> 00:00:19,890
I'll check her heart and lung rhythm

7
00:00:20,410 --> 00:00:24,180
Nothing serious happened to her

8
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,020
If you rest well and take the white medicine, you'll be fine.

9
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:30,010
It's just that one kidney is missing. If you don't believe it, see for yourself.

10
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:38,420
The one who operated on her originally

11
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:39,460
The doctor's skills are very poor

12
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,660
So bad that he doesn't even have any signs of practicing medicine.

13
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:44,300
Probably not even anesthetics
